{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07911","headline":"初年乐城馆中卧疾怀归作 · 孟浩然","name":"初年乐城馆中卧疾怀归作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"异县天隅僻，孤帆海畔过。\n往来乡信断，留滞客情多。\n腊月闻雷震，东风感岁和。\n蛰虫惊户穴，巢鹊眄庭柯。\n徒对芳尊酒，其如伏枕何。\n归屿理舟楫，江海正无波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}